window.SEORAP_DATA.documents.push({"id": "release418-notes", "project": "서랍마을", "section": "release", "subsection": "testing", "title": "1.0.366 (418) 내부 테스트", "description": "회의 주 의견·반응, 낮/밤 규칙 및 침대·욕구·가구 수정", "content": "# Internal 418 · 1.0.366\n\n## Included\n- Stable main opinions with multiple visible reactions. Main opinions may be queued during another opinion and follow its response window. Reactions add one pressure point; silence and stance-change controls are available.\n- Five-minute whole-meeting countdown; all surviving human players can skip together, advancing after two seconds. NPCs do not vote to skip.\n- New games use two daytime activity periods, meeting/vote, private Mafia night-target selection, then morning discovery. Daytime kills are disabled in this cycle. Existing games retain their day/night cycle.\n- Evidence shown as sentences. Presence observations alone do not increase pressure as proof. Specific time/place claims can be compared with firsthand surveys or the named partner’s own record. Intuition is explicitly uncertain, not role detection.\n- Game abilities page between former pages 9 and 10: deception, intuition, stealth, reasoning, observation, composure. Saved/shared with the character and used in observations/impressions.\n- Flow layout for expanding meeting speech and multiple reactions, no bottom scene-record block. Evidence at upper left, muted contextual memory; private evidence choices inline.\n- Single-bed visual dimensions halved from 417; duplicate catalog entry hidden while existing furniture persists. Sleeping status removed from the body anchor; pillow/quilt layers retained.\n- Need recovery projected continuously during activity, without double credit on save. Toilet recovery approximately one minute and its task duration one minute.\n- Furniture Other activities now constrained to that furniture. The complete activity catalog remains accessible from character commands.\n\n## Validation\n- 30 updated meeting games, 30 night-cycle games, 30 legacy games finish.\n- Multiple reactions, queued main opinion, reaction pressure, silence/stance, specific contradiction, private evidence authorization, human-only skip +2s, no daytime kill, private night target and morning discovery.\n- Chrome/WebKit KO/EN/JA small-screen meeting controls, long dialogue geometry, private night selection.\n- Chrome/WebKit contextual furniture filtering, complete self activity catalog, actual hug, abilities saved and reloaded/shared.\n- Single-bed front/right/left geometry and base/person/quilt layers; needs continuous recovery/no double credit; seating regressions.\n- Native module closure and packaged asset validation.\n\nNew/changed UI text: English 100%, Japanese 100%. Whole application coverage not measured. Real multi-device latency and gameplay balance still require internal playtesting; automated completion is not a balance claim.\n\n## Delivery\nSource b449a54 pushed to dev. Public app main is not merged with these new features.\nPlay release 310: 418 (1.0.366) available to internal testers, verified September 16 19:18 KST.\nSigned Android AAB SHA256: 4F74A49651CBC8DEB5177D8A5A58257C55C2DB7A490DE1F7A145375C974B2659. All 407 packaged assets match the prepared files.\nsharedTownApi deployment succeeded. Apple internal TestFlight run 35083679716 succeeded: uploadAccepted=true, internalOnly=true, submittedForReview=false. App Store Connect build a9287faa-90c0-49ad-a5bd-64e9bc69649c is Ready to Test, one existing internal tester invited. Android and Apple internal delivery verified September 16. No public promotion or website deployment.\n\n## Store notes\n<ko-KR>\n마피아 회의에서 주 의견과 여러 반응을 이어서 나눌 수 있어요. 침묵 지적·입장 변경, 회의 시간과 모두 넘기기를 추가했어요. 새 게임은 낮 활동·회의 후 밤에 표적을 고르고 다음 날 아침 발견해요. 증거 문장과 놀이 능력 설정을 추가하고 말풍선 겹침을 고쳤어요. 1인 침대 크기·잠자는 위치, 행동 중 욕구 회복과 가구별 행동 목록을 수정했어요.\n</ko-KR>\n<en-US>\nMafia meetings now connect main opinions and multiple replies, with silence questions, stance changes, a meeting timer and group skip. New games use daytime activities and meetings, private night targets and morning discoveries. Added evidence sentences and game abilities. Fixed overlapping dialogue, single-bed size and sleeping position, continuous need recovery and furniture-specific actions.\n</en-US>\n<ja-JP>\nマフィア会議で主意見と複数の反応を続けられます。沈黙への質問・立場変更、会議時間と全員スキップを追加。新規ゲームは昼の活動・会議後、夜に標的を選び翌朝発見します。証拠の文章表示と遊びの能力設定を追加し、吹き出しの重なり、シングルベッドの大きさと寝姿、行動中の欲求回復、家具別の行動一覧を修正しました。\n</ja-JP>\n"});

